# Applies to builds whose context is the repository root, which is
# apps/search-api/Containerfile only: its go.mod replaces both sub-repositories
# with their checkouts, so the context has to span them.
#
# Everything listed here is either a host build product or history no image
# stage reads, and together they are most of what the context would otherwise
# transfer.
# `**/` on every one: podman matches a pattern against the context-relative
# path segment by segment, so a bare `node_modules` excludes only a
# root-level entry and would leave apps/web-gui/node_modules (200 MB+) and
# both submodule .git directories in the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/apm_modules

# The end-to-end harness's two compiled daemons (~33 MB). Not a `**/` pattern
# because it names one directory, not a repeating one: deploy/test/build-images.sh
# writes them there, and the first build after a run would otherwise ship them.
deploy/test/bin
